sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If as many odd numbers as we please are added together, and their multitude is even, then the sum is even.
----
proof:

Let as many odd numbers as we please, {AB}, {BC}, {CD}, and {DE}, even in multitude, be added together.

I say that the sum {AE} is even.

